{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story Background</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are an interstellar explorer, dispatched alone to a remote star system. Your official mission is clear: establish an orbital outpost and begin mining a rare superconductive mineral crucial to humanity\u2019s future. But as you expand your operations and dig deeper into the system, strange anomalies begin to surface. Who\u2014or what\u2014left these traces behind? What forces are truly at play?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beneath the silence of space, a larger struggle awaits discovery.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay Overview</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a space strategy and simulation game with a strong focus on orbital mechanics. You will:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scan and identify asteroids with varying mineral compositions\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605470/extras/416449ce76be840aebf086e3b44d4963.avif?t=1756744140\" data-has-big width=1560 height=882 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harvest raw resources and refine them through in-space chemical processing<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605470/extras/e93cc6355341d904179a44ccfaff8239.avif?t=1756744140\" data-has-big width=1560 height=882 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Construct and expand modular orbital infrastructure, from storage hubs to research stations<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605470/extras/569ba0f8ca689d9ea8d73b3de03d063d.avif?t=1756744140\" data-has-big width=1560 height=882 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605470/extras/0989850c2aff2fdacc284283f578980b.avif?t=1756744140\" data-has-big width=1560 height=882 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the physics of orbital maneuvers and manage limited delta-v and fuel efficiency to keep your operations sustainable<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605470/extras/d8618cf448de1ccf667de152c0d74d53.avif?t=1756744140\" data-has-big width=1560 height=882 /></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Experimental Combat Concept</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An early prototype for orbital detection and interception is already in place. Future combat features\u2014still under experimentation\u2014will focus on <strong>beyond-visual-range engagements</strong> based on <strong>strategic orbital planning and delta-v management</strong>, rather than close-quarters action or reflex-based gameplay.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Localization</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experimental AI translations (de, es, pt, ja, fr, pl, ko, ru). I can\u2019t guarantee the quality since I don\u2019t speak these languages, so I won\u2019t officially mark them as supported\u2014but I decided to keep them anyway, just in case. Please keep in mind there\u2019s no quality assurance.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3605470?t=1756744140","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3605470?t=1756744140","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605470/4d13decee7382f52e5984e94c49da77d36e02ce4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756744140","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605470/4d13decee7382f52e5984e94c49da77d36e02ce4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756744140","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story Background</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are an interstellar explorer, dispatched alone to a remote star system. Your official mission is clear: establish an orbital outpost and begin mining a rare superconductive mineral crucial to humanity\u2019s future. But as you expand your operations and dig deeper into the system, strange anomalies begin to surface. Who\u2014or what\u2014left these traces behind? What forces are truly at play?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beneath the silence of space, a larger struggle awaits discovery.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay Overview</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a space strategy and simulation game with a strong focus on orbital mechanics. You will:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scan and identify asteroids with varying mineral compositions\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605470/extras/416449ce76be840aebf086e3b44d4963.avif?t=1756744140\" data-has-big width=1560 height=882 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harvest raw resources and refine them through in-space chemical processing<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605470/extras/e93cc6355341d904179a44ccfaff8239.avif?t=1756744140\" data-has-big width=1560 height=882 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Construct and expand modular orbital infrastructure, from storage hubs to research stations<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605470/extras/569ba0f8ca689d9ea8d73b3de03d063d.avif?t=1756744140\" data-has-big width=1560 height=882 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.aka