"}],"short_description":"A sci-fi settlement building game with orbital mechanics. Start from a spaceship, scan asteroids, manage fuel, ore, electricity, time, and sanity, while expanding your settlement, exploring an alien solar system, and building stations and spacecraft to support your growing colony.","steam_appid":3605470,"support_info":{"email":"ship37game@gmail.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English, Simplified Chinese","type":"game","website":null}